BT /F1 12 Tf 0.13 0.10 0.22 rg 52 602 Td (The access token is a signed JWT. It proves who you are to protected endpoints for) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.13 0.10 0.22 rg 52 585 Td (15 minutes and lives in frontend memory. The refresh token lives in an HttpOnly) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.13 0.10 0.22 rg 52 568 Td (browser cookie, so page scripts cannot read it. The refresh session lasts seven) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.13 0.10 0.22 rg 52 551 Td (days by default.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 0.38 0.22 0.67 rg 52 514 Td (6. Refresh restores or renews your session) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.13 0.10 0.22 rg 52 491 Td (On reload, the app uses the cookie to get a new access token, then calls) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.13 0.10 0.22 rg 52 474 Td (/api/auth/me for your current profile. Each successful refresh replaces the old) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.13 0.10 0.22 rg 52 457 Td (refresh token. If several protected requests get a 401 together, they share one) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.13 0.10 0.22 rg 52 440 Td (refresh and each eligible request retries once.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 0.38 0.22 0.67 rg 52 403 Td (7. Protected pages and logout) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.13 0.10 0.22 rg 52 380 Td (The route guard sends signed-out visitors from /dashboard to /login. Signed-in) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.13 0.10 0.22 rg 52 363 Td (visitors are sent from login or signup to /dashboard. Sign out deletes the matching) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.13 0.10 0.22 rg 52 346 Td (session and clears the cookie and frontend state. A previously issued access token) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.13 0.10 0.22 rg 52 329 Td (can still work until it expires.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 0.38 0.22 0.67 rg 52 292 Td (Try it in your browser) Tj ET
